{"id": "CO4-3", "year": 2012, "exam_question": 15, "paper_pdf_page": 2, "paper": "editorial/sources/exams/exam_2012_rebuild.pdf", "paper_kind": "社区二手复原；不代表官方原卷或官方答案发布", "wangdao_section": "2.3", "wangdao_question_number": 30, "provided_native_pdf_page": 133, "main_book_answer": {"num": 30, "answer": "D", "page": 82, "y": 258.36, "line": "30. D", "crops": [{"page": 82, "bbox": [54, 258.36, 489, 398.04]}], "book": "/workspace/study_analysis/v2/books/王道2027计算机组成原理_高清带书签版.pdf", "subject": "CO", "section": "2.3"}, "provided_question_text": "30.【2012 统考真题】某计算机存储器按字节编址,采用小端方式存放数据。假定编译器规定int 型
和short 型长度分别为32 位和16 位,并且数据按边界对齐存储。某C 语言程序段如下:
struct {
int a;
char b;
short c;
}record;
record.a = 273;
若record 变量的首地址为0xC008,地址0xC008 中的内容及record.c 的地址分别为(
)
A. 0x00, 0xC00D
B. 0x00, 0xC00E
C. 0x11, 0xC00D
D. 0x11, 0xC00E
